  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your mastery of spiritual harmony allows you to manipulate auras.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Aura Absolution<sup>MIM</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> As long as you have at least 1 point in your ki pool, your bonus on saves against alignment-based effects and the DC of caster level checks with alignment-based effects is increased to 4. When you would be affected by an alignment- based effect, you can spend 1 point from your ki pool as an immediate action to use imbue with aura on yourself, lasting a number of rounds equal to your mythic tier. Whenever you use this feat to duplicate imbue with aura, remove curse, or atonement, you add your mythic tier to your caster level for all purposes.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-ki-feats#toc3\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
